{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 771286379</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why Are 3D Board Games So Cool?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Battle:</strong><br>A flat board only has &quot;length&quot; and &quot;width,&quot; but a 3D board adds &quot;height&quot;! With attacking, defending, and surrounding, the number of possible strategies multiplies, challenging your brain to think even faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Games, New Experiences:</strong><br>Familiar games, brand-new excitement! In 3D Chinese Chess, your &quot;Chariot&quot; might &quot;fly&quot; through the air to checkmate the opponent. In 3D Go, you might surround territory on a\u7acb\u4f53 &quot;mountain.&quot; Just thinking about it is thrilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Varieties:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhombic Dodecahedron Go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual-Directional Chinese Chess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Gomoku</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Reversi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-Player 3D International Chess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-Player 3D Chinese Chess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-Layer Chinese Chess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borderless Go</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless switching between single-player and online multiplayer modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game review mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple time limit options for matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point system and global leaderboard</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938350?t=1760837703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938